[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0010","text":"那么，制作人\n辛苦了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0020","text":"干杯～♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0030","text":"干杯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0040","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0050","text":"嗯～！\n好好喝～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0060","text":"是啊\n工作结束后的一杯果然特别棒啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0070","text":"对吧～！\n为什么这么好喝呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0080","text":"也许疲劳变成了一种调味料吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0090","text":"？\n调味料……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21900300_02_0100","text":"你看，天热的时候冰淇淋会觉得更好吃对吧？\n就是那种“产生加成效果的东西”的意思"}]
